 of Sihon king of the Amorites, who reigned in Heshbon, whom Moses struck with the chiefs of Midian, Evi…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Judges 6:1","note":"The children of Israel did that which was evil in Yahweh’s sight, so Yahweh delivered them into the hand of Midian seven years.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Kings 11:18","note":"They arose out of Midian, and came to Paran; and they took men with them out of Paran, and they came to Egypt, to Pharaoh king of Egypt, who gave him a house…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:32","note":"The sons of Keturah, Abraham’s concubine: she bore Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, and Shuah. The sons of Jokshan: Sheba and Dedan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 83:9","note":"Do to them as you did to Midian, as to Sisera, as to Jabin, at the river Kishon;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0028","lemma":"אֲבִידָע","transliteration":"avida","gloss":"Abida"},{"id":"H0085","lemma":"אַבְרָהָם","transliteration":"avraham","gloss":"Abraham"},{"id":"H0420","lemma":"אֶלְדָּעָה","transliteration":"eldaah","gloss":"Eldaah"},{"id":"H2175","lemma":"זִמְרָן","transliteration":"zimran","gloss":"Zimran"},{"id":"H2585","lemma":"חֲנוֹךְ","transliteration":"chanokh","gloss":"Enoch"},{"id":"H3327","lemma":"יִצְחָק","transliteration":"yitschaq","gloss":"Isaac"},{"id":"H3370","lemma":"יׇקְשָׁן","transliteration":"yoqshan","gloss":"Jokshan"},{"id":"H3435","lemma":"יִשְׁבָּק","transliteration":"yishbaq","gloss":"Ishbak"}],"senses":[{"id":"H4080H","gloss":"Midian","relation":"H4080H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}